            "review_title": "Review at Warning Zone 173 Hai Bà Trưng",
            "review_text": "Paulus54\nStoke Bruerne, United Kingdom664 contributions\n0\nProbably OK if you like beer or carbonated drinks.\nMar 2025 • Couples\nWe visited the Warning Zone opposite the Novotel Hotel at 146 Hai Ba Trung St., District 1 (which isn’t in TA, but as it’s a chain, I assume it’s pretty much the same). \nIt seemed a nice idea - sitting outside in the bustling Hanoi evening, but no drinks for a non-beer drinker who also isn’t a fan of coke/pepsi/7up etc. \nNo water nor juice. \nSo we left! \nShame.\nRead more\nWritten March 16, 2025",
